Caelza: the brand pass over every dashboard page (vision M4 phase 4b).

The theme map gives the dashboard our palette, but black and cyan read as
any dark console. These hunks, with the rules in the overlay's
caelza-brand.css, make every page unmistakably ours without touching the
pages' markup: the mark and the wordmark in the top bar on every width
(the page title beside them where there is room, under a hairline of the
mark gradient), page titles in the mark gradient (PageHeader), the primary
action filled cyan → violet (Button), and Space with the nebula glows
behind every page (Layout; the glow colours are theme variables set by
runtime/lib/dashboard_theme.py, so another theme gets a plain base).
Applied after 0009 and the overlay copy.

